# Keep LF in the repository for every text file.
#
# This bundle contains multi-byte UTF-8 (Chinese strings in the prompt and UI
# text). Normalising line endings here keeps the working tree byte-stable across
# platforms, which matters twice over for this plugin: a changed byte anywhere in
# the request prefix invalidates provider cache reuse from that token.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
